  Findings (Kawanishi Ren)
====================================================================
  Accuracy : DLGN lags behind Transformer but learning converges
  DLGN PPL=11.83  TF PPL=4.86  ratio=2.44x
  Speed  : Hard circuit is 1.2x faster than Transformer
  Collapse : soft 18,299 -> hard 61,991 tok/s

  [Conclusion]
  - DLGN can learn Char-LM (perplexity decreases during training)
  - Inference works even after collapsing to hard Boolean circuit
  - Speed bottleneck: large input dim (context_len*vocab_size)
  softmax-based input selection in DynamicGateLayer dominates
  - For production: embedding dimension reduction or coarse one-hot

